    "text": "Leofan men, do\u00f0 swa eow mycel \u00feearf is, understanda\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cristen man ah micle \u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t he his\nWac bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00f0anc on cristenum men gyf he ne cann understandan \u00feurh rihtne geleafan \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00fee hine\nFor\u00f0am mid \u00feam o\u00f0rum sceal \u00e6lc cristen man hine to Gode gebiddan, & mid \u00feam o\u00f0rum geswutelian\nCrist sylf sang pater noster \u00e6rest & \u00fe\u00e6t gebedd his leorningcnihtum t\u00e6hte; & on \u00f0am godcundan\nAc hu m\u00e6g \u00feonne \u00e6fre \u00e6nig man hine inweardlice to Gode gebiddan buton he inwerdlice on God\nLeofan men, ures Drihtnes agene leorningcnihtas, \u00e6r hy toferdan, ealswa heom beboden w\u00e6s,\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6ne geleafan mot \u00e6lc \u00f0\u00e6ra rihtlice cunnan & anr\u00e6dlice healdan \u00fee geearnian wile ece myrh\u00f0e \u00e6t\nLeofan menn, understanda\u00f0 swy\u00f0e georne \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00e6fre habban rihtne geleafan on \u00e6nne \u00e6lmihtigne\nAn is ece God, f\u00e6der \u00e6lmihtig, \u00fee gescop heofonas & eor\u00f0an & ealle gesceafta.\nOn \u00fe\u00e6ne we gelyfa\u00f0 & on his sunu, urne Drihten Crist, & on \u00feone halgan gast: \u00fe\u00e6t is eall an so\u00f0 Godd,\nEalle \u00fea \u00f0ry naman befeh\u00f0 an godcund miht, & is untod\u00e6led an ece Godd, waldend & wyrhta ealra\nEac we gelyfa\u00f0 & georne witan \u00fe\u00e6t Crist Godes sunu is \u00e6g\u00f0er ge so\u00f0 Godd on godcundnesse ge eac\nEal mancyn w\u00e6s \u00feurh deofles lare \u00e6r \u00feam beswicen & forworht into helle wite.\nAc God \u00e6lmihtig \u00f0urh his mildheortnesse, \u00fea \u00fea he wolde mancynn of deofles gewealde ahreddan, \u00fea\nAnd sona swa he \u00fe\u00e6t word gecw\u00e6\u00fe & heo hit mid geleafan underfeng, \u00fea wear\u00f0 heo \u00feurh haligne gast\nHit weox \u00fea sy\u00f0\u00f0an & \u00f0eah on menniscnesse, swa his sylfes willa w\u00e6s, o\u00f0 se tima com \u00fe\u00e6t he fur\u00f0or\nHit is on hr\u00e6dinge earfo\u00f0recce hw\u00e6t he gesawenlicra wundra geworhte \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste gewurde.\nHe h\u00e6lde blinde & deafe & dumbe & mistlice gebrocode & ar\u00e6rde m\u00e6nigne man of dea\u00fee & \u00e6t\nHine man band, & hine man swang, & \u00e6t nyhstan on rode aheng, & him \u00e6g\u00f0er \u00feurhdraf mid isenum\nAnd hine man sy\u00f0\u00f0an on eor\u00f0an bebyrigde.\nHu mihte \u00e6fre mare wundor gewur\u00f0an \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00f0e ah geweald heofones & eor\u00f0an &\nAc hit wear\u00f0 \u00feeah mancynne to mycelre \u00feearfe, for\u00f0am \u00fee we ealle wurdan \u00fea alysede mid his\nOn \u00feam sylfum f\u00e6ce \u00fee se mennisca lichama on byrgene l\u00e6g, he abr\u00e6c \u00feurh his godcundan mihte helle\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s \u00feriddan d\u00e6ges of dea\u00f0e aras, & m\u00e6nige eac ar\u00e6rde \u00fee lange \u00e6r deade w\u00e6ron.\n\u00d0a he geswutelode \u00fe\u00e6t he ah \u00e6g\u00f0er geweald ge lifes ge dea\u00fees, & eac \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s \u00fea swytol \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6r\nAc he ahredde us \u00feurh his dea\u00f0 of ecan dea\u00f0e, & gerymde us weg to ecan life.\nWe agan nu geweald hw\u00e6\u00feer we geearnian willan \u00fee ece lif & ece blisse, \u00fee ecne dea\u00f0 & endelease\nWitodlice witan we moton hu we Criste geleanian eal \u00fe\u00e6t he for us & for ure lufan \u00feafode & \u00f0olode.\nLeofan men, \u00e6fter his \u00e6riste sy\u00f0\u00f0an he of dea\u00f0e arisen w\u00e6s, he com to his \u00f0egnum & hy gegladode &\nAnd on \u00f0am feowerteoge\u00f0an d\u00e6ge he astah to heofonum & \u00f0\u00e6r on his wuldre wuna\u00f0 & rixa\u00f0.\nLeofan men, we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halig gela\u00f0ung sy ealra cristenra manna to anum rihtan geleafan, & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t haligra gemana sy.\nHalige men habba\u00f0 gemanan her on life on godum d\u00e6dum, & hy habba\u00f0 eac gemanan on \u00fe\u00e6m\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t synna forgyfenes sy \u00e6rest \u00feurh rihtne geleafan & \u00f0urh fulluht & eft \u00feurh synna\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rist sy on domesd\u00e6ge ealra manna.\nAnd we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif sy, for\u00f0am ealswa \u00fea godan habba\u00f0 ece lif on myrh\u00f0e, swa habba\u00f0 \u00fea\n\u00d0am yrmingan w\u00e6re micle betere, gif hit beon mihte, \u00fe\u00e6t hi swa deade w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t hy \u00f0a yrm\u00f0a leng\nHeora lif nis naht buton seo m\u00e6ste yrm\u00f0 \u00fee \u00e6fre gewar\u00f0 & is rihtor to talianne to ecan dea\u00f0e \u00feonne to\nEala, leofan menn, hw\u00e6t, we georne geseo\u00f0 & gelomlice gecnawa\u00f0 be \u00f0am tacnum \u00fee Crist sylf\nNe wyr\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r bedihlad \u00fe\u00e6t dihlyste ge\u00feanc \u00fee \u00e6ni man \u00e6fre ge\u00f0ohte, buton hit \u00e6r geandet & gebet\nEall middaneard bi\u00f0 \u00feonne on d\u00e6g byrnende, & eall mancyn sceall \u00fe\u00e6nne of dea\u00f0e arisan & \u00f0urh \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 \u00feonne on d\u00e6g gryre se m\u00e6sta, for\u00f0am \u00feurh Godes mihte bi\u00f0 eal astyred ge heofonwered ge\nAc \u00f0\u00e6r gewyr\u00f0 \u00f0urh Godes mihte ra\u00f0e toscaden \u00fe\u00e6t wered on twa, & sculan \u00fea forwyrhtan \u00fee her on\n\u00d0\u00e6r is ece bryne grimme gemencged, & \u00f0\u00e6r is ece gryre; \u00fe\u00e6r is wanung & granung & a singal sorh.\nWa \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r sceal wunian on wite.\nHim w\u00e6re betere \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6fre on worulde man ne gewurde \u00feonne he gewurde.\nNis se man on life \u00fee areccan m\u00e6ge ealle \u00fea yrm\u00f0a \u00fee se gebidan sceal se \u00fee on \u00f0a witu ealles\n\u00d0yder sculan mannslagan, & \u00f0ider sculan manswican.\n\u00d0ider sculan \u00e6wbrecan & \u00f0a fulan forlegenan; \u00f0ider sculan mansworan & mor\u00f0wyrhtan; \u00f0ider sculan\nWa heom \u00fe\u00e6s si\u00f0es \u00fe\u00e6t hi men wurdon.\nAc do nu manna gehwylc swa him mycel \u00feearf is, geswice yfeles & bete his misd\u00e6da \u00fea hwile \u00fee he\nGod is swy\u00f0e mildheort & wile swy\u00f0e gemildsian & mycel forgyfan \u00feam \u00fee mid inwerdre heortan\nAc wa \u00f0am \u00fee on yfele \u00feurhwunia\u00f0 & nan \u00feing ne beta\u00f0.\nHi sculan witodlice mid ealle forweor\u00f0an.\nEala, eala, ges\u00e6lig bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wered \u00fee \u00feonne on domesd\u00e6ge asyndred wyr\u00f0 fram deofles gemanan: \u00fe\u00e6t\nHi sculon \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s ece lean habban.\nHeom \u00feonne on d\u00e6g Crist sylfa to clypa\u00f0 & luflice ge\u00feanca\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hi on life him rihte gehyrdon, &\nAnd hy \u00f0onne fara\u00f0 mid Gode sylfum & mid his englum on ecne gefean heofona rices.\n\u00d0\u00e6r is m\u00e6r\u00f0 & myrh\u00f0 & ece blis.\nNis \u00e6fre \u00e6nig man \u00fee sylf ge\u00feencan cunne o\u00f0\u00feon o\u00f0rum areccan m\u00e6ge hwylce \u00fea m\u00e6r\u00f0a & \u00f0a\nAnd se \u00f0e to \u00feam ges\u00e6lig bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he to \u00f0am m\u00e6r\u00f0um & to \u00feam myrh\u00f0um cym\u00f0, ne ateoria\u00f0 hy him\nNu ic h\u00e6bbe eow areht rihtne geleafan.\nSe \u00f0e hine aht \u00feisses tweo\u00f0 & his gelyfan nele, ne cym\u00f0 he \u00e6fre to Godes rice gyf he on \u00feam geenda\u00f0.\nAnd se \u00f0e \u00f0onne rihtne geleafan h\u00e6f\u00f0 & his ealles gelyf\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e ic rehte \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0urh God gewear\u00f0 & gyt\nUtan for\u00f0am don swa us micel \u00feearf is, habban aa on an on urne Drihten rihtne geleafan & lufian hine\n& \u00e6nig man o\u00f0rum ne beode butan riht: \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa o\u00f0rum beode \u00fe\u00e6t he wille \u00fe\u00e6t man him\nSe by\u00f0 wel cristen \u00fee \u00feis gehealde\u00f0, & gyf we \u00feis gehealde\u00f0, \u00feonne geearnige we \u00fe\u00e6t we habban",
